sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant P as Customer panel
    participant I as InquiryService
    participant DB as Oracle
    participant S as StageRunner
    participant SA as Sabte Ahval
    participant E as 8 other inquiries
    U->>P: start inquiries
    P->>I: POST .../requests/{id}/inquiries
    I->>DB: SELECT FOR UPDATE NOWAIT, record run (or attach to the running one)
    I-->>P: 202 runId
    I-)S: run asynchronously on a virtual thread
    Note over S: StructuredTaskScope stage 1, deadline 10 s
    S->>SA: GetEstelamSabt (Bearer gateway token)
    SA-->>S: statusField, isaliveCode, gender, birth date
    S->>DB: save inquiry row (attempt, result, raw response)
    alt Sabte Ahval NEGATIVE
        S->>DB: request REJECTED, outbox SMS 8
    else Sabte Ahval FAILED
        S->>DB: run BLOCKED (stage 2 not started)
    else PASSED
        Note over S: Stage 2, deadline 15 s, gender + birth date in context
        par forks on virtual threads
            S->>E: Shahkar, Sepad (men 18 to 50 only), Blacklist, SamaCheque
        and
            S->>E: Samat, BoardRelation, ImportCommitment, ExportCommitment
        end
        E-->>S: results (first NEGATIVE cancels the others)
        S->>DB: save one row per inquiry
        alt any NEGATIVE
            S->>DB: request REJECTED with SRS message, outbox SMS 8
        else any FAILED
            S->>DB: run BLOCKED, retry allowed after 60 s
        else all PASSED or SKIPPED
            S->>DB: run PASSED, go to collateral
        end
    end
    loop every few seconds
        P->>I: GET .../inquiries/{runId}
        I->>DB: read run + inquiry rows
        I-->>P: status of each of the 9 inquiries
    end
